# Juspeace BE (`juspeace-be`)

## Layering (required)

```text
Controller → Service → Repository interface → Prisma implementation
```

- Controllers: HTTP + DTO + Swagger only
- Services: business rules; inject repository **interfaces**, not Prisma
- Repositories: all Prisma/SQL
- DTOs: `class-validator` / `class-transformer` with whitelist

## Stack

- NestJS 11, Prisma 6, PostgreSQL
- Global prefix `/api/v1`, Swagger `/docs`
- Money as integer `priceCents` + ISO currency

## Do

- Resource URLs (`/products`, `/products/:slug`)
- Nest exceptions + global problem-details filter
- Migrations under `prisma/migrations/`; update `docs/glossary.md` for new terms

## Don't

- Prisma/SQL in controllers
- Skip DTO validation
- Hardcode secrets/ports
- Initialize git in this package

## Skills to apply

- `juspeace-backend` (primary)
- `juspeace-clean-architecture`, `backend-patterns` when relevant
- `juspeace-integration` when changing FE/BE contracts

## Verify

```bash
cd juspeace-be && pnpm run build && pnpm test && pnpm run lint
```

